{
  "total_duration": 49.44,
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "来看第二题，向量共线。",
      "file": "seg_001.wav",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.4,
      "duration": 2.4
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "已知平面向量a和b不共线。",
      "file": "seg_002.wav",
      "start": 2.9,
      "end": 5.46,
      "duration": 2.56
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "也就是说，a和b是两个独立的方向。",
      "file": "seg_003.wav",
      "start": 5.96,
      "end": 9.48,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "等式是2a加yb等于xa减3b。",
      "file": "seg_004.wav",
      "start": 9.98,
      "end": 13.98,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "这道题考的是什么？",
      "file": "seg_005.wav",
      "start": 14.48,
      "end": 15.92,
      "duration": 1.44
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "两个向量相等，当且仅当它们的系数分别相等。",
      "file": "seg_006.wav",
      "start": 16.42,
      "end": 20.26,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "所以我们把a的系数和b的系数分开看。",
      "file": "seg_007.wav",
      "start": 20.76,
      "end": 23.64,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "左边a的系数是2，右边是x。",
      "file": "seg_008.wav",
      "start": 24.14,
      "end": 27.02,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "所以x等于2。",
      "file": "seg_009.wav",
      "start": 27.52,
      "end": 28.8,
      "duration": 1.28
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "左边b的系数是y，右边是负3。",
      "file": "seg_010.wav",
      "start": 29.3,
      "end": 32.02,
      "duration": 2.72
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "所以y等于负3。",
      "file": "seg_011.wav",
      "start": 32.52,
      "end": 34.6,
      "duration": 2.08
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "答案选A。",
      "file": "seg_012.wav",
      "start": 35.1,
      "end": 36.22,
      "duration": 1.12
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "这道题的核心思想是向量分解。",
      "file": "seg_013.wav",
      "start": 36.72,
      "end": 39.28,
      "duration": 2.56
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "a和b不共线，所以它们线性无关。",
      "file": "seg_014.wav",
      "start": 39.78,
      "end": 42.82,
      "duration": 3.04
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "系数必须一一对应。",
      "file": "seg_015.wav",
      "start": 43.32,
      "end": 45.08,
      "duration": 1.76
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "记住这个套路，向量等式就拆系数。",
      "file": "seg_016.wav",
      "start": 45.58,
      "end": 48.94,
      "duration": 3.36
    }
  ]
}